      "claim": "Harold King is known for novelizing the miniseries \"World War III\" and being named \"the crown prince of suspense\" by Publishers Weekly in 1979.",
      "answer": "novelizing the miniseries \"World War III\" and being named \"the crown prince of suspense\" by Publishers Weekly in 1979",
      "quote": "under the pen name \"Brian Harris\" he novelized the miniseries \"World War III\" His best-selling \"Closing Ceremonies,\" with the streamer \"Nazi Evil Lives On . . . And a Hunt to the Death Begins,\" prompted \"Publishers Weekly\" to name King in 1979 \"the crown prince of suspense.\"",
